<title>HONG KONG: Dao Heng places HK$250 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Dao Heng places HK$250 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dao Heng Bank's HK$250 million floating rate certificate of deposit issue has been privately placed, arranger Tokyo-Mitsubishi said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The facility has two tranches.</p>
<p>Tranche A is a HK$150 million issue due on April 7, 1998. Tranche B is a HK$100 million due on October 6, 1997.</p>
<p>Both tranches were priced at par. Tranche A pays a coupon of 23 basis points over the three-month Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate. Tranche B pays a coupon of HIBOR plus 11 basis points.</p>
<p>Fees were not available.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
